# > Bitget & Bitget Wallet (原 BitKeep) 全终端覆盖

# 1. User-Agent 规则：精准捕获 iOS/Android/桌面端 App 的流量
USER-AGENT,Bitget*
USER-AGENT,*bitget*
USER-AGENT,BitKeep*
USER-AGENT,*bitkeep*
USER-AGENT,BitgetWallet*
USER-AGENT,com.bitget.*
USER-AGENT,com.bitkeep.*

# 2. 域名后缀规则：匹配 Web 端网页、App 底层 API 及短链接系统
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bitget.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bitget.fit
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bitget.site
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bitget.vip
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bitget.media
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bitgetapp.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bg.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bgapp.com

# Bitget Wallet / BitKeep 专属及生态域名
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bitgetwallet.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bitkeep.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bitkeep.vip
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bitkeep.org

# 3. 关键字规则：兜底拦截，覆盖其跨域调用的静态 CDN、第三方客服或 KYC 验证组件
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,bitget
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,bitkeep
